        :end-byte 10724,
        :raw-sha256
        "f52a8a2deda3f9694f52afae70de5727cb14300a2a0a776e309243485e262e35"},
       :path
       "docs/phase-01-core-language/024-l14-language-facet-system-specification.md",
       :ref "86747916c4c876d707a1548113409fb939d854c9",
       :file-sha256
       "14646a93de90f03ad7134174cfe09975485e7852626b9ea1bff803979f2ea645",
       :raw
       "- `:core` accepts only facets that lower fully to portable typed core.\n- `:hosted` may permit facets backed by hosted runtimes, reflection, or dynamic\n  loading when effects and capabilities are declared.\n- `:native` may permit facets that emit target-specific ABI, layout, vector, FFI,\n  or linker artifacts.\n- `:kernel`, `:firmware`, and `:hardware` require facets to avoid managed-runtime\n  assumptions unless those assumptions are modeled by the target.\n- `:distributed` requires replay-safe effects and deterministic workflow artifacts.\n- `:ai` requires model, prompt, tool, memory, and evaluation provenance.\n- `:meta` may inspect compiler internals only through declared compiler APIs.\n"}
