       :file-sha256
       "abcb402eaf0f2c2a6b44b78ff33c252590d57bd2bcb62fed67a8e4e9176b14b0",
       :raw
       "`gravity.text` owns these String semantics. The existing core compatibility\nspelling does not establish an implemented `gravity.text` export or grant\nprofile, target or host-service permission. Convertibility to String does not\nmake Bytes, an arbitrary Text/view value or a host text carrier a String.\n"}
