       :file-sha256
       "abcb402eaf0f2c2a6b44b78ff33c252590d57bd2bcb62fed67a8e4e9176b14b0",
       :raw
       "`gravity.text` defines strings, Unicode text processing, encodings, parsing, formatting, and locale-explicit text APIs.\nIt separates bytes from text and scalar values from grapheme clusters.\nIt gives macros, schemas, IO, HTTP, AI prompts, UI libraries, diagnostics, and generated artifacts a common text contract.\n"}
