       :raw-sha256
       "45a8a47ce1acdaca787565276db5bbe53800b35d3d5718e731fedfb17209778c",
       :raw
       "- `R5`, `R6`, `R10`, `R11`, and `R12` define memory, concurrency, FFI,\n  capability, and observability runtime details.\n",
