       :raw
       "- `R10-CAPABILITY` for foreign actions without runtime authority.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R10/source/ae0fd9495f9ea0cb4a57d38bf9f698fa723ccecb981ec9f4b42575b7a811c282",
