       "f769ff005fa6eb17ffbae98ca8e083e1e158b70c2c19797f4bd42cee6c373290",
       :raw
       "- `SAFE5`, `SAFE7`, `SAFE10`, and `SAFE11` define resources, interop,\n  capabilities, and taint.\n",
