      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/116-r5-memory-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "8b5342b2c4ea517679cc7dfebd52a13aab247b358eaf42f4247e2fe4deca4197",
       :raw
       "- Every allocation provider must have a manifest naming profile support,\n  allocation effects, layout, alignment, failure behavior, lifetime model,\n  deallocation strategy, debug hooks, and unsafe implementation boundaries.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R5/source/0c3fd611d2ed4dbbd2ebe174352e3e15bc3b6c1190b8fd5a5bc6cec6c7b8b952",
