      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/116-r5-memory-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "670c82f970c48d14da5ec8bc6b56c6694809f5b1004973f8f665ae0a3d65ce0b",
       :raw
       "- `R5-RAW` for raw-memory use outside unsafe policy or safe wrappers.\n",
