      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "c1fc1b15160ff6dde92404332a4cc71c422e4d4aa97edc20afeeaf3064d8384d",
       :raw
       "Interactive evaluation is a runtime service with authority and reproducibility\nrisks. It is unavailable in profiles that forbid dynamic evaluation or managed\nservices, and it must record enough session state to explain generated code,\ndiagnostics, and artifacts.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R9/source/83c8a9ec0edfc1e6068bf9e36c55e3875da07d106df5a451df13917f06882e0b",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r9/b8a922a6d114f816ad7a4f97",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R9",
       :end-byte 854,
       :start-byte 591}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/120-r9-repl-and-interactive-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "463fabc00cde3d2085d5aa47c0806872c686448c94b270579bf5f492c559e12d",
       :raw
       "- `P3`, `P4`, and `P13` define meta, hosted, and profile compatibility rules.\n",
