       :raw-sha256
       "88d3633258eba61f416ced3d44e284268b24f60cfc337810ff78222026267ec8",
       :raw
       "- Resolver effects must be explicit and capability-checked at runtime.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S4/source/862dbdb4528d678f7211c3cc1cc13fef29a633f201fc07a52ba676158db9cdc5",
