      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/148-s4-graphql-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "a1c9dc958e569122967b04fbd79d2575fe05bb3d0bb30c1acc8dac1776c94f0e",
       :raw "- `S4-AUTH` for missing authorization metadata.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S4/source/a498d37428bb77fd94e70869a494208c25fbf569b177f4eb5a31bff4f81b5e1f",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s4/421190763534684a6763470c",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "S4",
       :end-byte 2890,
       :start-byte 2842}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/148-s4-graphql-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "695e4c73cc891c3801d56270f2c590baffee54d6f2cdfa7fe046592f10e5865d",
       :raw
       "Gravity rejects resolvers with hidden IO or model/tool effects.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S4/source/7a3fef17f7c020b12a5da48a4493bcfe1fbc6725000abcb1af075ff15aefa039",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s4/572309f02c8028457bccc3a2",
       :kind :negative-case,
       :document-id "S4",
       :end-byte 3478,
       :start-byte 3414}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/148-s4-graphql-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "d53fd9cb8e22c87dd1f919c59c0e98ebef88b881a2867bea3d46652a6b70ef3b",
       :raw "- Auth/capability metadata.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S4/source/a452b3cb54b54c329d6ab80e6b38d27829dba6ff1a107656e16e4d25ba966813",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s4/663e182fc36507874d0a444b",
       :kind :artifact,
       :document-id "S4",
       :end-byte 1871,
       :start-byte 1843}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/148-s4-graphql-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "a97ba0021039753e9a7ddc53bf83622fd6d3c724fd059404a45faa59c8147d4a",
       :raw
       "- GraphQL generation must declare source schemas, resolver declarations,\n  query/mutation/subscription effects, auth/capability policy, error model,\n  naming policy, nullability mapping, pagination policy, and compatibility mode.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S4/source/862dbdb4528d678f7211c3cc1cc13fef29a633f201fc07a52ba676158db9cdc5",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s4/83006865983d44d83eff6056",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "S4",
       :end-byte 923,
       :start-byte 693}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/148-s4-graphql-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "ca8d31bb51224407bd2de906523e4d8c7502cd44f45fb8252fd6113574b021a3",
       :raw
       "Gravity schemas remain authoritative. GraphQL output is a generated boundary\nartifact, not the source of truth.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S4/source/d11f3a6b45529d354741ce4da42d5804e82e8e0043c70dd06794ead4898b2c22",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s4/8f934194838e5c29cadc7f15",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "S4",
       :end-byte 675,
       :start-byte 563}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/148-s4-graphql-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "216d618469f21f9a36e538463264c287ae84558eb6f22472827ad0b508be7dc0",
       :raw
       "- Generated SDL must preserve metadata needed for auth, validation, source maps,\n  and compatibility checks.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S4/source/862dbdb4528d678f7211c3cc1cc13fef29a633f201fc07a52ba676158db9cdc5",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s4/d49e7d3883721ae4c27cc732",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "S4",
       :end-byte 1234,
       :start-byte 1125}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/149-s5-openapi-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "eb20745ee0613eda5e153e25afcb8b2d32b69bd3c04264f0fd51e124bc56d21e",
       :raw
       "- Generated OpenAPI must preserve source spans, schema hashes, route ids,\n  compatibility policy, auth metadata, and examples.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S5/source/ce3d7fecd74907971724c815608aeca809ee2a85ac6ba29e205c3b13ec047b6b",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s5/23630f6961fa9cc56cb10f36",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "S5",
       :end-byte 1108,
       :start-byte 981}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/149-s5-openapi-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "9221ec4d868306ba2eebdcd5c87720bcea6b2bb34f8f9370c64039ddcaf66142",
       :raw "Gravity rejects undocumented handler effects.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S5/source/3e82164313a07fcb8bef960d841765ca3f3c5ae631b8875b54c8746dca997a4c",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s5/7273d90871ba719b5c0cf37d",
       :kind :negative-case,
       :document-id "S5",
       :end-byte 3524,
       :start-byte 3478}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/149-s5-openapi-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "927b597bc7315a962ab25b7a1ef7b2667b067ec1551b046260b3e95f45e5205f",
       :raw
       "Diagnostics must include route id, source span, method/path, schema id, effect,\ncapability, compatibility status, and remediation.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S5/source/01360f2ac4e467ba19c41bcf7e69e544fd24d646e6c7e4e7c27202a7da2f00b4",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s5/8a6d7969a75c67a6f8b1d984",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "S5",
       :end-byte 3309,
       :start-byte 3178}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/149-s5-openapi-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "cdf4b7d7a83113419867aa299227a86dff1593d2c13bf87c4e0dfae3874ae17c",
       :raw
       "- Every exposed route must declare method, path, path/query/header/body schemas,\n  response schemas, error envelopes, status codes, auth/capability policy,\n  effects, idempotency when relevant, and versioning metadata.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S5/source/ce3d7fecd74907971724c815608aeca809ee2a85ac6ba29e205c3b13ec047b6b",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s5/9b57a3ee7783baa510a4b271",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "S5",
       :end-byte 940,
       :start-byte 721}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/149-s5-openapi-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "fd869691dc42756a8e1d479cba4971a480e2c47f0e0f9f7a2c89d014f7e205e2",
       :raw
       "Route mapping covers method, path, path/query/header/body parameters,\nserialization format, status codes, error envelopes, auth requirements,\nidempotency keys, pagination, rate-limit metadata, examples, and deprecation.\nUnsupported schema features require adapters or rejection.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S5/source/587113b2b347be65ffea9f8c2968c142427fd0db89ee6dd77d63555252989d23",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s5/b70e3f3378c7d6f25652e20c",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "S5",
       :end-byte 2524,
       :start-byte 2245}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/149-s5-openapi-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "8eef3ccc55586bc3a2bc75797aee4c5eefbe0c3ce44a89afc0f66d049ac1a01c",
       :raw
       "Gravity rejects treating OpenAPI documents as authoritative source schemas.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S5/source/2799e9ee4ac2aaea96f256ec7b610bf9af098f4c707d927bf2173f079a7dbe5d",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s5/cf335d33213133c9439d7385",
       :kind :negative-case,
       :document-id "S5",
       :end-byte 3477,
       :start-byte 3401}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/149-s5-openapi-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "9ac0ff2a43f7eb9ba5217080a1d7625e15463d2a41683cd628b0aa8431ec9a36",
       :raw
       "The OpenAPI artifact is generated evidence. Gravity route and schema source\nremain authoritative.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S5/source/130e0a28313bc63538ddc0b3701bc4dd0bff6e77c39133bc4256b6d61cd587af",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s5/d56fab1cfc23ccf0fd481855",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "S5",
       :end-byte 703,
       :start-byte 605}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/149-s5-openapi-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "295bbf26a83edc7b5f73a33c8af3225fea5862e1406b853debd36f1851dc2518",
       :raw "- `S5-CAPABILITY` for route effects outside grants.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S5/source/891b5df16dfa6e636a7aa5594eddbba06b53875cdf5f5028bc0c279268e56467",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s5/eb1012b12bedc0c2d50d8a0d",
       :kind :diagnostic,
       :document-id "S5",
       :end-byte 2835,
       :start-byte 2783}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/149-s5-openapi-generation-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "d53fd9cb8e22c87dd1f919c59c0e98ebef88b881a2867bea3d46652a6b70ef3b",
       :raw "- Auth/capability metadata.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "S5/source/c963ff9ce0ab1371db2111900ea9bda7f3811a35c159528e3c2e1f620b5a61c8",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/s5/ec2cabebae14906f66c8af1c",
       :kind :artifact,
       :document-id "S5",
       :end-byte 1832,
       :start-byte 1804}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-10-schema-data-and-interop/149-s5-openapi-generation-design.md",
