       :raw-sha256
       "7973d06921eebff69be8b6ce72cbbdb75bb3aaf2d3272ea9d0707bc461c92190",
       :raw
       "- `R1`, `R7`, `R11`, and `R12` define shared runtime, distributed, capability,\n  and observability integration.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R8/source/6271b1e9a4d5852c60f947d5c1ed6934e75cec899a89ce8c50dff3452c30b2b0",
