       :raw-sha256
       "d0398a9f4950d89378e868d05fb08a1c7243a82e2e92b4a525a049830632e4fa",
       :raw
       "- Phase 11 defines agents, prompts, tools, memory, policy, human-review, replay, and\n  evaluation artifacts.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R8/source/6271b1e9a4d5852c60f947d5c1ed6934e75cec899a89ce8c50dff3452c30b2b0",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r8/43dfec4f2b3ecf7ae0bba77f",
