       :document-id "R8",
       :end-byte 2246,
       :start-byte 2137}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/119-r8-ai-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "ca8cd81cf5e04abd195866cf4dbc37a8758751b0a438febfe9ca5eec0a8b2bf7",
       :raw
       "Memory records include retention, deletion, privacy, trust, taint, source,\nembedding provider, retrieval policy, and secret status. Retrieved content is an\nuntrusted input unless a policy marks it otherwise after validation. Model output\ncannot flow into code execution, shell, filesystem write, deployment, package\nmutation, secret access, or database write sinks without validation and\ncapability checks.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R8/source/97ca599bfd9f0083db22a64211922a9ea62b0a6895a189e30190517fa91c4960",
       :id "facet/runtime-domains-schema/r8/602e4a8e3db98546d6f4efa8",
       :kind :condition,
       :document-id "R8",
       :end-byte 4667,
       :start-byte 4260}
      {:path
       "docs/phase-08-runtime-architecture/119-r8-ai-runtime-design.md",
       :raw-sha256
       "8e5d34605f2270dd876f573fec1460f890a57013d1013cd4c06c31c6104d381a",
       :raw
       "Tool invocation records include tool id, input/output schemas, effects,\ncapabilities, side-effect class, human-review requirement, timeout, retry, provider,\nsecret policy, taint policy, and result validation. Human-review records include\nreviewer identity class, decision, scope, time source, and audited rationale\nschema.\n",
       :source-occurrence-id
       "R8/source/b69eda97e102147a164f18ef2679b8da83842fa52304a09ffaaa28b6b17da5c3",
