       :raw-sha256
       "115399798a66a00db2ba4e1b43a116994e9c3bcc39e4acde8c7ea587682b92bd",
       :raw
       "- Model calls require `:ai/model-call` effect, provider capability, model\n  identity, prompt provenance, output schema or validation policy, ",
