       :source-path
       "docs/phase-16-standard-library/213-std3-collections-library-specification.md",
       :raw-text
       "The initial List compiler subset accepts exactly a homogeneous Keyword List\nand returns a bare Set. The input has no established static length; conversion\nestablishes no Set member-domain, cardinality, order or nonempty refinement.\nArbitrary sequence views and nil remain outside this conversion contract.\nExisting Vector conversion behavior is preserved.\n",
       :source-file-sha256
       "58d096cc16d922ad72d560c5b3e4d60d093c9527a9472c2414d63deb98630e3d",
       :id "stdlib/facet/std3/6712-7068",
       :kind :acceptance-rule,
       :document-id "STD3",
